            "review_text": "Lyle129\nHanoi, Vietnam47 contributions\n0\nDelicious!The m\nAug 2016 • Couples\nFor the food, I would give this restaurant 4 stars. Already eating here twice, I was never disappointed by the quality of the food. The salads are awesome, fresh, creatively-mixed and tasty. \nI would highly recommend the steak. I was a little bit hesitant when my bf chose the steak since the price is not that expensive in compared with the steak in other places. I did think that it would taste yucky. But unexpectedly, the steak was very good. \nThe drinks are fabulous! I love it a lot. If I don't go for some bites here, I will still definitely order the drink. \n\nThe minor room to improve here might be the service. The staff are young, and responsive, but except for the safeguard, most of them are quite stressed out. But this is very minor, and still Home-Cook BB is worth of coming back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 21, 2016",
