            "review_text": "Tom V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam122 contributions\n0\nSmokey Chaos\nJul 2016 • Family\nMy HaNoi friends took me to this restaurant because I wanted to eat rice for lunch. What a disaster. The decor is nice and tables good size. Staff were slow to get the menu (an ominous sign).\n\nAfter ordering we waited and waited for our 6 dishes of BBQ pork and rice in various combinations of sauce and extras.\n\nThe room filled up with smoke from the kitchen below (my clothes still smell of the smoke). Nothing came. Waiters rushed around and delivered plates to people who came in after us. My plate arrived after 15 minutes, but how could I eat while 5 hungry faces looked on.\n\nAnother plate arrived about 7 minutes later, then 2 more plates 10 minutes after that and the final one 7 minutes after that = total 34 minutes from ordering!\n\nThe food was good when it arrived, and the bill came quickly.\n\nI hope the management gets it's ordering system worked out. Yes I know it takes time for pork to BBQ. However if you tell customers how long is the waiting time will be when they walk in might help.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 14, 2016",
